OL,3,GNEWSARogue landlord to challenge
OL,4,Astripping of OBE
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rogue landlord who is being stripped
OL,7,Fof his OBE says he is going to
OL,8,Fchallenge the taking away of his
OL,9,Fhonour.
OL,11,FNirpal Riat, from Hounslow in west
OL,12,FLondon, has been told he has to forfeit
OL,13,Fthe honour following his conviction for
OL,14,Funlawfully renting out property, which
OL,15,Fthe council described as being in a
OL,16,F"woeful" condition, and a fine of more
OL,17,Fthan #300,000.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
