OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARogue landlord to challenge
OL,4,Astripping of OBE
OL,5,
OL,6,FHounslow Council's deputy leader, Tom
OL,7,FBruce, welcomed the decision, saying it
OL,8,Fshows there will be "consequences for
OL,9,Frogue landlords who put their tenants'
OL,10,Fwelfare at risk".
OL,12,FIt is very unusual to take away an
OL,13,Fhonour over a housing offence - but
OL,14,Fformer Home Office minister Norman
OL,15,FBaker backed the idea of removing
OL,16,Fhonours for such serious cases.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
